Usage: agent-deck group update <name> [options]

Update group settings.

Options:
  -clear-default-path
    	Clear group default working directory
  -default-path string
    	Default working directory for new sessions in this group
  -json
    	Output as JSON
  -max-concurrent int
    	Cap simultaneous running sessions in this group (0=unlimited, 1=serial, N=cap) (default -1)
  -q	Minimal output (short)
  -quiet
    	Minimal output

Examples:
  agent-deck group update mobile --default-path /path/to/repo
  agent-deck group update mobile --clear-default-path
  agent-deck group update mobile --max-concurrent 2
